From 864b0a038ef12b20f8d93589f05d658ebc0365ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:29:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Compose deferred host gathering with same-page DMA-BUF import

Add an explicit paired host-memory source so devices without host-pointer imports can materialize a deferred CPU window and then export those same pages. Preserve the existing gather route for eligible pointer devices and require a full Pointer answer plus a writable mapping before DMA import.

Document mapping ownership independently of callback retention, error propagation, and read-only twin requirements. Add focused full-window and refusal contract tests. Refusal reference generation and whitespace checks completed; Rust test execution is pending the serialized validation slot.
